---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Orbwalker"
  description="Orbwalker is a fantasy match-3 roguelike for mobile, with free orb movement and build-driven runs."
  image="/img/orbwalker.jpg"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap page">
      <span class="eyebrow moss">Games division · Playable</span>
      <h1>Orbwalker</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A fantasy match-3 roguelike for mobile. You drag one orb freely around the board, and every orb it
        passes moves out of the way.
      </p>

      <img class="wide-img" src="/img/orbwalker.jpg" alt="Orbwalker title screen" width="720" height="405" />

      <p class="muted">
        Each run is a string of fights, shops and relics. You build a set of upgrades as you go, and the
        enemies show their next move so you can plan around it. One person built it from an empty project to
        a playable game in three months.
      </p>

      <div class="shots">
        <img src="/img/orbwalker-combat.jpeg" alt="Orbwalker combat" loading="lazy" width="490" height="1080" />
        <img src="/img/orbwalker-shop.jpeg" alt="Orbwalker shop" loading="lazy" width="490" height="1080" />
        <img src="/img/orbwalker-relic.jpeg" alt="Orbwalker relic choice" loading="lazy" width="490" height="1080" />
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn main" href="https://rajahafify.itch.io/orbwalker" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Play on itch.io</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/yOek_scKUMY" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the short</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
